  "title": "Air-Fried Artichoke Hearts with Lemony Mayo",
  "description": "Prepare these crunchy artichoke hearts in the air fryer with a lemony mayo for a savory appetizer everyone will love.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole McLaughlin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-12-07T07:30:31-05:00",
